 		return KErrNotSupported;
+	// N95 hybrid (docs/hacks.md H-no-ram-kernel-drivers): a driver loaded from C:/E: was built
+	// against the N95's 9.2 kernel, whose DObject is 12 bytes smaller and has two virtuals fewer;
+	// run on this kernel its vtable slots and fields are off (RomPatcher+'s patcherShadow.ldd
